        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
                "word": "similitude",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "71ae0f50-cc8b-4f86-93a4-c01f3f7bfccb",
                        "entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "similitudes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc7da8ac-7e0a-3b25-a718-0ba08e364f80",
                        "entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État de deux choses semblables, similarité."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Didactique"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a32277d-5c24-4898-b533-41254801a8a8",
                                "sense_id": "bc7da8ac-7e0a-3b25-a718-0ba08e364f80",
                                "text": "La similitude de deux triangles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06ad2fe8-de4a-4402-ad9f-c6cb5255a2c5",
                                "sense_id": "bc7da8ac-7e0a-3b25-a718-0ba08e364f80",
                                "text": "Il y a entre ces deux espèces d’animaux une grande, une exacte similitude de conformation."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "175c3097-bde0-3a14-8a00-6ca424a17510",
                        "entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Comparaison prolongée, analogie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2664b24-b72e-4ebe-ba78-af3b85b081ec",
                                "sense_id": "175c3097-bde0-3a14-8a00-6ca424a17510",
                                "text": "Les similitudes sont souvent employées dans l’évangile."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a1bf0e5-d4ea-37d9-b1b4-02e410e0e004",
                        "entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ressemblance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Langage courant"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9e547ee-e9c2-4e55-9914-a3b12127dc2c",
                                "sense_id": "4a1bf0e5-d4ea-37d9-b1b4-02e410e0e004",
                                "text": "Cette similitude harmonique avait une cause géogastronomique : Un déjeuner en compagnie d’un secrétaire de mairie dans une auberge médoquine, la proximité d’un excellent pinard du cru, une belle journée de printemps peuvent en effet enrichir ces fréquences d’une vibration issue du fond des âges, comme qui dirait, une remontée du temps par des voies papillaires dans un double-fond de terroir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44937973-c218-4a89-8bc4-4ec6debf2a12",
                                "sense_id": "4a1bf0e5-d4ea-37d9-b1b4-02e410e0e004",
                                "text": "Quant au seul motif de la tête du Christ, il montre des similitudes significatives avec celui de la Pietà de Souain-Perthes-lès-Hurlus, dans le département de la Marne ; il s'agit là d'une tête d'un volume très semblable, au visage structuré par les mêmes rapports de proportions, et caractérisé par le même abandon et une semblable dispersion de la chevelure, glissant sur le côté gauche du cou et chutant sur l'épaule et le bras droits."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b8510fac-8bcc-3a5e-a0a7-88b76a4107df",
                        "entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Transformation dans un plan euclidien qui multiplie les distances par un réel strictement positif k."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "88de1a1e-36ff-4f46-85f8-8d981a08f0a2",
                        "source_entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
                        "target_lang_word": "similitude",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "similitude",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5d6d733-c0a0-3ac4-8248-7485a948775d",
                                        "entry_id": "5efa456c-bb9f-3187-9278-8118eb123cd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Similarity or resemblance to something else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ec363cc-b5f5-40f3-a8ab-152cda6b6055",
                                                "sense_id": "e5d6d733-c0a0-3ac4-8248-7485a948775d",
                                                "text": "So am I tossed on the ebbing tide of life—now in sunshine, now in shade—seemingly free, yet, in reality, fettered by the strong, though slight chain of circumstance. For a small sum, any passenger may enter that boat and direct its course; and here again is similitude. I am at the beck of others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df285a76-b53a-4568-b59b-ed566e6919fe",
                                                "sense_id": "e5d6d733-c0a0-3ac4-8248-7485a948775d",
                                                "text": "Aemulation was similitude within distance: the sky resembled a face because it had “eyes” — the sun and moon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfc2ffd5-b718-3980-be8f-664634531d89",
                                        "entry_id": "5efa456c-bb9f-3187-9278-8118eb123cd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A way in which two people or things share similitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9abdfb27-b310-4710-bf37-1e183fe8482e",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc2ffd5-b718-3980-be8f-664634531d89",
                                                "text": "Aemulation was similitude within distance: the sky resembled a face because it had “eyes” — the sun and moon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "534c10f7-26b6-3ce9-b788-b5f841cb8cbd",
                                        "entry_id": "5efa456c-bb9f-3187-9278-8118eb123cd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that closely resembles another; a duplicate or twin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7397579c-91e3-4f1f-b364-24a04e620241",
                                                "sense_id": "534c10f7-26b6-3ce9-b788-b5f841cb8cbd",
                                                "text": "If I was certain of anything in the world, I was certain that I had seen my brother in the study — nay, more, had touched him, — and equally certain that I had seen his double — his exact similitude, in the garden."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "216e207e-e771-3d79-9247-3f991584c2ad",
                                        "entry_id": "5efa456c-bb9f-3187-9278-8118eb123cd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A parable or allegory."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26a06b1e-0d48-4384-bd27-cea957e34db5",
                                                "sense_id": "216e207e-e771-3d79-9247-3f991584c2ad",
                                                "text": "And he spake many thynges to them in similitudes, sayinge: Beholde, the sower wentt forth to sowe, And as he sowed, some fell by the wayes side [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "604b4923-482e-3289-a2e1-0734399f241d",
                                        "entry_id": "5efa456c-bb9f-3187-9278-8118eb123cd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A similarity: a transformation of Euclidean space that preserves angles and the ratios of distances."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "092632f2-1388-4adb-8b21-351df8457fdd",
                        "source_entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
                        "target_lang_word": "sameness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sameness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84a08b9a-74d0-358e-ac9d-cbcc87cfbef8",
                                        "entry_id": "7d55fb8b-09e9-39fc-9f50-b7712d0facaf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being the same; identity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2094601-236c-41e8-a3d9-18230548bd8a",
                                                "sense_id": "84a08b9a-74d0-358e-ac9d-cbcc87cfbef8",
                                                "text": "All of them agreed that the working-classes must be kept in their place; and all of them perceived that American Democracy did not imply any equality of wealth, but did demand a wholesome sameness of thought, dress, painting, morals, and vocabulary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6597d81-9f9d-44bc-b136-cae395325090",
                                                "sense_id": "84a08b9a-74d0-358e-ac9d-cbcc87cfbef8",
                                                "text": "However strange it may sound, it always seemed to me […] that Adrian's laughter-filled friendship with Schildknapp had something to do with the sameness of their eye color"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f935939f-1b5d-32a3-ba55-0a95c1f849eb",
                                        "entry_id": "7d55fb8b-09e9-39fc-9f50-b7712d0facaf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being equivalent; equality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42316c18-e7d2-32cd-aea4-79de995333c7",
                                        "entry_id": "7d55fb8b-09e9-39fc-9f50-b7712d0facaf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tiring lack of variety; monotony."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7349474-3a82-4797-863b-c22c663fcf80",
                                                "sense_id": "42316c18-e7d2-32cd-aea4-79de995333c7",
                                                "text": "[…] in the time when day follows day in dull, unexpectant sameness, and trial is a dreary routine,—it is then that despair threatens […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0acb8a2-9274-43ce-b1da-10e1cf980be0",
                                                "sense_id": "42316c18-e7d2-32cd-aea4-79de995333c7",
                                                "text": "O to sail to sea in a ship! / To leave this steady unendurable land, / To leave the tiresome sameness of the streets, the sidewalks and the houses, / To leave you O you solid motionless land, and entering a ship, / To sail and sail and sail!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "db4c4c77-48f9-4d3c-b10d-566837735869",
                        "source_entry_id": "61422706-a349-3f0b-b8ca-899287b37aaf",
